- Port each function in port.mojo, then: mojo-anything record [CWD]/mojo/textkit-mojo && mojo-anything build [CWD]/mojo/textkit-mojo && mojo-anything diff [CWD]/mojo/textkit-mojo
- Class `Stack` is not bridged to Mojo yet; it stays in Python.
- `walk` stays in Python: generator: returns a lazy iterator.
- `apply` stays in Python: calls its parameter `fn`: a callable.
- `configure` stays in Python: takes `**kwargs`.
- `Limits` stays in Python: class: decorated with `@dataclasses.dataclass`, public class attribute `max_length`, public class attribute `sep`.
